            <formatted-text>
              <run bold="false" fontcolor="#132342" fontname="Segoe UI" fontsize="12">Prioritize East and Office Supplies for source-record review; these are overlapping views. More orders did not offset lower sales per order. Request quantity and unit-price detail
before attributing the change to pricing or product mix.</run>
